            "text/markdown": "We duplicated an acceleration-triggered switch circuit for redundancy. Both copies use the same design. We then rotated the boards to fit a new enclosure, but plan to skip dynamic testing because the circuit worked on an earlier vehicle. What risks should our design review address, and which LLIS lessons support those concerns?"
