              "<h3>5. <a href='https://llis.nasa.gov/lesson/614' target='_blank'>GSE Test Rig Installation</a></h3><p>Lesson 614 · Similarity 0.674</p><p>Source flags: missing_section</p><details><summary>Matched passage</summary><pre style='white-space:pre-wrap'>DRIVING EVENT\n",
